      "text": "# ApexRec: HD Screen Recorder \u0026 Creator Studio\n\nThe native Android screen recorder and creator studio **ApexRec** has been implemented following all specifications, technical decisions, and UI requirements.\n\n---\n\n## Technical Highlights \u0026 Architecture\n\n### 1. Build \u0026 Manifest Configurations\n- **Dependencies** configured in [`build.gradle.kts`](file:///app/build.gradle.kts) and root [`build.gradle.kts`](file:///build.gradle.kts):\n  - **CameraX** (`camera-core`, `camera-camera2`, `camera-lifecycle`, `camera-view`) for the circular floating facecam.\n  - **Coil** (`coil-compose`, `coil-video`) for asynchronous video thumbnail decoding.\n  - **Room Database** (`room-runtime`, `room-ktx`, `room-compiler`) for metadata indexing and storage aggregation.\n  - **Accompanist Permissions** for runtime camera, audio, and notification checks.\n  - **Media3 / ExoPlayer** for in-app video playback and scrubbing.\n- **System Permissions \u0026 Service Declaration** in [`AndroidManifest.xml`](file:///app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml):\n  - Declared `FOREGROUND_SERVICE`, `FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PROJECTION`, `RECORD_AUDIO`, `CAMERA`, `POST_NOTIFICATIONS`, `VIBRATE`, and `SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW`.\n  - Configured `ScreenRecordService` with `android:foregroundServiceType\u003d\"mediaProjection\"`.\n  - Configured `FileProvider` with [`file_paths.xml`](file:///app/src/main/res/xml/file_paths.xml) for video sharing.\n- **App Metadata**: Updated [`metadata.json`](file:///metadata.json) with app identity and feature breakdown.\n\n### 2. Audio \u0026 Video Engine Core\n- **[`ScreenRecordService.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/service/ScreenRecordService.kt)**:\n  - Binds Android `MediaProjection` to a hardware `VirtualDisplay`.\n  - Configures `MediaRecorder` with studio presets up to 2K (2560×1440) at 90 FPS and 24 Mbps bitrate.\n  - Broadcast-quality 48 kHz AAC audio capture mixing microphone with internal gameplay audio.\n  - Interactive foreground system notification with live elapsed time, Pause/Resume, and Stop controls.\n  - Periodic audio amplitude sampling powering live waveform visualizer flows.\n- **[`RecordingConfig.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/service/RecordingConfig.kt)** \u0026 **[`RecordingState.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/service/RecordingState.kt)**:\n  - Type-safe presets for SD 480p, HD 720p, FHD 1080p, 2K 1440p; 30, 60, 90 FPS; 8, 16, 24 Mbps.\n\n### 3. Motion \u0026 Sensor Engine\n- **[`ShakeDetector.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/sensor/ShakeDetector.kt)**:\n  - Hardware accelerometer listener implementing `SensorEventListener`.\n  - Computes jerk delta: $\\Delta a \u003d |\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + z^2} - g|$ against configurable thresholds (Low, Medium, High).\n  - Integrated 800ms debounce cooldown and haptic pulse feedback via Android `Vibrator` / `VibratorManager`.\n\n### 4. Floating Facecam Overlay (CameraX)\n- **[`CameraXFacecam.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/components/CameraXFacecam.kt)**:\n  - Draggable circular Picture-in-Picture badge with touch gesture modifiers.\n  - Instant front/back camera lens switching (`CameraSelector.DEFAULT_FRONT_CAMERA` vs `CameraSelector.DEFAULT_BACK_CAMERA`).\n  - Size switching (Small 110dp, Medium 150dp, Large 190dp) and close action.\n  - Cyber border styled with Electric Cyan (`#00F0FF`) and pulsing ring animation.\n\n### 5. Lossless Keyframe Video Trimmer\n- **[`LosslessTrimmer.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/processing/LosslessTrimmer.kt)**:\n  - High-speed demuxing/remuxing engine using native Android `MediaExtractor` and `MediaMuxer`.\n  - Cuts MP4 streams at keyframes (`SEEK_TO_PREVIOUS_SYNC`) in milliseconds with zero quality loss and zero re-encoding overhead.\n  - Transfers H.264 and AAC tracks with updated presentation timestamps.\n- **[`ThumbnailUtils.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/processing/ThumbnailUtils.kt)**:\n  - Extracts keyframe video thumbnails and video metadata via `MediaMetadataRetriever`.\n\n### 6. Room Data Layer\n- **[`RecordingEntity.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/data/RecordingEntity.kt)**: Room table schema caching video path, resolution, FPS, bitrate, file size, duration, audio source, and timestamp.\n- **[`RecordingDao.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/data/RecordingDao.kt)**: Reactive Kotlin `Flow` queries for cataloging, search, deletion, title renaming, and total disk storage calculation.\n- **[`ApexRecDatabase.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/data/ApexRecDatabase.kt)**: Room database singleton.\n\n### 7. Jetpack Compose UI Screens \u0026 Cyber Dark Theme\n- **Theme \u0026 Styles**:\n  - [`Color.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/theme/Color.kt): Void black (`#070A0F`), deep slate (`#0B0E14`), surface slate (`#151B26`), Electric Cyan (`#00F0FF`), Crimson Neon (`#FF0055`), Acid Lime (`#39FF14`).\n  - [`Type.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/theme/Type.kt) \u0026 [`Theme.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/theme/Theme.kt): Monospaced digital readouts and cyber dark styling.\n- **Components**:\n  - [`CyberComponents.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/components/CyberComponents.kt): Cards, badges, chip selectors, and the glowing `PulseRecordButton`.\n  - [`AudioWaveformVisualizer.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/components/AudioWaveformVisualizer.kt): Animated Acid Lime and Electric Cyan amplitude frequency bars.\n- **Screens**:\n  - [`DashboardScreen.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/dashboard/DashboardScreen.kt): Studio dashboard with quality dials, audio source switcher, countdown animation ([`CountdownOverlay.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/dashboard/CountdownOverlay.kt)), floating facecam toggle, and recording controls.\n  - [`GalleryScreen.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/gallery/GalleryScreen.kt): Grid/list of recordings with thumbnails, storage meter, rename dialog ([`RenameDialog.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/gallery/RenameDialog.kt)), delete confirmation, and share intent.\n  - [`VideoPlayerAndTrimmerScreen.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/player/VideoPlayerAndTrimmerScreen.kt): Custom ExoPlayer player with variable speed scrubbing (0.5x–2.0x), dual trim handles, and instant lossless export.\n  - [`ApexRecViewModel.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/ui/viewmodel/ApexRecViewModel.kt) \u0026 [`MainActivity.kt`](file:///app/src/main/java/com/apexrec/app/MainActivity.kt): State orchestration and Cyber bottom navigation.\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\nThe build and verification script [`compile_applet`](file:///usr/local/bin/compile_applet) was executed to validate all components:\n\n```bash\ncompile_applet\n```\n\n```\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n  ApexRec: HD Screen Recorder - Verification \u0026 Compilation Suite\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n[*] Project root detected at: /app\n[1/8] Verifying metadata.json...\n  [OK] metadata.json verified: ApexRec: HD Screen Recorder\n[2/8] Verifying build.gradle.kts (CameraX, Coil, Room, Accompanist, Media3)...\n  [OK] Gradle dependencies verified successfully.\